===Format===
* '''Playoffs:''' July ''03<sup>th</sup>'' - ''16<sup>th</sup>, 2023''
** Hybrid Elimination Bracket
*** 12 teams, 4 Invited and 8 Preliminary Stage teams
*** Preliminary Stage teams compete in Knockout Round
*** Invited teams are seeded into Upper Bracket Quarterfinals
** Knockout Round is Single-Elimination
** Upper Bracket Quarterfinals and onwards is Double-Elimination
** Knockout Round, {{Abbr|UB|Upper Bracket}} Quarterfinals, {{Abbr|LB|Lower Bracket}} Round 1 and {{Abbr|LB|Lower Bracket}} Quarterfinals are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** All other matches are {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 3 teams}} will qualify for '''[[VCT/2023/Champions|Champions '23]]'''

