===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''' June ''11<sup>th</sup>'' - ''14<sup>th</sup>, 2023''
** Two double-elimination format (GSL) groups
*** 8 Low Seed teams
*** Each group has 4 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} from each group advance to the '''Playoffs'''

* '''Playoffs:''' June ''16<sup>th</sup>'' - ''25<sup>th</sup>, 2023''
** Double-Elimination bracket 
** 8 teams, 4 High Seeds and 4 Qualified teams
** All matches ''(excl. Lower Bracket Final and Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Lower Final and Grand Final are {{Abbr/Bo5}}
* {{Bgcolortext|up|Three best-placed '''EMEA''' teams}} qualify to '''[[VCT/2023/Champions|Champions '23]]'''
* {{Bgcolortext|down|Worst placed '''EMEA''' team}} qualifies to '''[[VCT/2023/EMEA_League/Last_Chance_Qualifier|EMEA Last Chance Qualifier]]'''

