===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''' February ''22<sup>nd</sup>'' - February ''26<sup>th</sup>'', 2023''
** Three double-elimination format (GSL) groups
*** Each group has 4 teams, except Group C, which has 3 teams
**** [[EDward Gaming]] receives a bye in Group C as the region's highest-placing team at [[Champions 2023]]
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top team}} from each group will advance to the '''Playoffs'''
** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|Second place team}} from each group advances to the '''Play-In''' 

* '''Play-In''': February ''27<sup>th</sup>'', 2024
** Three team Single Round-Robin group
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Winning team}} will advance to the '''Playoffs'''
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for tiebreaker rules''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="margin-left:45px">
*2-way tie
*# Head-to-head Match Score
*3-way tie
*# Head-to-head Match Series
